      "start_line": 12,
      "text": "  rule <k> #isEqualToSumEven(N:Int)\n        => Call(\n             closureVal(\n               (\"n\", .ParamNames),\n               (Return(\n                  BoolOp(\n                    \"and\",\n                    ( Compare(Name(\"n\"), CmpOp(\">=\", Int(8)))\n                    , Compare(\n                        BinOp(\"%\", Name(\"n\"), Int(2)),\n                        CmpOp(\"==\", Int(0)))\n                    , .Exprs)))\n                .Stmts),\n               0),\n             (N, .Exprs))\n           ... </k>"
    }
